---

## 📋 About

This repository contains the **data, pre-trained DNN surrogate model weights,
simulation results, and validation figures** for the paper:

> **"Reliability-Constrained Available Transfer Capability Assessment
> using Deep Neural Network Surrogate: Real Renewable Energy Uncertainty
> and Carbon Budget Constraint"**
>
> K. Majumdar · S. Ghosh · N. Kumar
> *IEEE Transactions on Reliability*, 2026

### ✨ Key Highlights

| Feature | Detail |
|---------|--------|
| 🤖 DNN Surrogate | R² = 0.9975 / 0.9675 / 0.9999 on three power systems |
| ⚡ Speedup | ~1400× faster than full AC-OPF solver |
| 🌿 Carbon-Aware | Soft penalty guidance term in fitness function |
| 📊 Reliability | VaR₉₀ constraint on ATC distribution |
| 🗺️ Systems | IEEE 30-bus · IEEE 118-bus · NRPG 246-bus (India) |
| 🔍 Validation | 500 independent out-of-sample NREL scenarios |

---

